# Legacy redirects are implemented in src/lib/redirects.ts, consumed by
# src/middleware.ts, not here.
#
# On Cloudflare Workers, @astrojs/cloudflare v14 routes every request through
# the Worker (there is no separate static-asset tier that falls through to a
# file like this one first), so a rule here would never run ahead of the
# Worker's own routing. Keeping the redirect map in middleware means dev,
# preview and production all resolve legacy URLs the same way.
